WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.551 --> 00:00:02.385
&gt;&gt; Tucker: I LIVE HERE AND SO DO

00:00:02.386 --> 00:00:03.720
MY KIDS.

00:00:05.823 --> 00:00:07.790
WE CAN AGREE ON THAT.

00:00:07.791 --> 00:00:12.896
&gt;&gt; Tucker: LAST WEEK WE WELCOMED

00:00:12.897 --> 00:00:14.898
A GUEST TO DISCUSS WHETHER

00:00:14.899 --> 00:00:19.903
CHICAGO SHOULD BE A SANCTUARY

00:00:19.904 --> 00:00:21.704
CITY AND WE HAD A SPIRITED

00:00:24.341 --> 00:00:25.275
OBLIGATION TO REPRESENT AMERICAN

00:00:25.276 --> 00:00:26.643
CITIZENS FIRST ABOVE PEOPLE WHO

00:00:26.644 --> 00:00:29.979
ARE HERE ILLEGALLY?

00:00:29.980 --> 00:00:33.216
&gt;&gt; I REPRESENT MY CITIZENS VERY

00:00:33.217 --> 00:00:34.651
WELL, THANK YOU.

00:00:34.652 --> 00:00:36.286
&gt;&gt; Tucker: OKAY -- YOU AREN'T

00:00:36.287 --> 00:00:36.920
GOING TO SAY.

00:00:42.326 --> 00:00:44.460
BLUE-EYED AND BLOND FOR YOUR

00:00:44.461 --> 00:00:44.827
AMERICA.

00:00:44.828 --> 00:00:47.497
&gt;&gt; Tucker: WHAT A LOATHSOME

00:00:47.498 --> 00:00:48.731
LITTLE DEMAGOGUE YOU ARE TO SAY

00:00:48.732 --> 00:00:52.168
THAT.

00:00:57.341 --> 00:01:00.410
WE HAVE ANOTHER GUEST NOT IN THE

00:01:00.411 --> 00:01:02.845
CITY'S EFFORTS TO PROTECT

00:01:02.846 --> 00:01:03.680
CITIZENS FROM AMERICAN LAW.

00:01:03.681 --> 00:01:05.815
THANK YOU FOR COMING ON TONIGHT.

00:01:05.816 --> 00:01:07.817
SO I DIDN'T MEAN TO GET INTO

00:01:07.818 --> 00:01:11.487
SUCH A BITTER DEBATE WITH YOUR

00:01:11.488 --> 00:01:13.189
COLLEAGUE BUT I WAS ASKING HOW

00:01:13.190 --> 00:01:14.490
IT HELPS THE AMERICAN CITIZENS

00:01:14.491 --> 00:01:15.959
IN CHICAGO TO DO THIS AND HE

00:01:15.960 --> 00:01:17.327
CALLED ME A BIGOT IN RESPONSE.

00:01:17.328 --> 00:01:19.929
LET ME ASK YOU THE SAME

00:01:19.930 --> 00:01:22.865
QUESTION, DOES IT HELP PEOPLE

00:01:22.866 --> 00:01:24.701
FROM CHICAGO ON THE IMMIGRATION

00:01:24.702 --> 00:01:25.134
POLICIES.

00:01:25.135 --> 00:01:27.770
&gt;&gt; OF COURSE NOT, IT DOESN'T

00:01:27.771 --> 00:01:28.705
HELP ONE BIT.

00:01:28.706 --> 00:01:29.472
&gt;&gt; Tucker: SO WHAT'S THE POINT

00:01:29.473 --> 00:01:29.973
OF IT?

00:01:29.974 --> 00:01:35.178
I THOUGHT THE POINT OF

00:01:35.179 --> 00:01:36.980
REPRESENTING A CONSTITUENCY WAS

00:01:36.981 --> 00:01:38.948
TO LOOK OUT FOR THE VOTERS.

00:01:38.949 --> 00:01:40.516
&gt;&gt; THAT'S HOW I FEEL.

00:01:40.517 --> 00:01:41.651
WE REPRESENT THE PEOPLE WHO LIVE

00:01:41.652 --> 00:01:43.119
IN OUR COMMUNITY AND CITY AND

00:01:43.120 --> 00:01:45.188
PEOPLE HERE, I BELIEVE, YOU HAVE

00:01:45.189 --> 00:01:46.756
TO BE HERE LEGALLY.

00:01:51.595 --> 00:01:52.729
WHO VISITS IT.

00:01:52.730 --> 00:01:54.864
THERE'S GREAT PEOPLE, GREAT

00:01:54.865 --> 00:01:56.332
FOOD, BEAUTIFUL CITY BUT LIKE

00:01:56.333 --> 00:01:58.434
ALL CITIES IT HAS ACTUAL

00:01:58.435 --> 00:01:59.802
PROBLEMS, FINANCIAL PROBLEMS,

00:01:59.803 --> 00:02:00.403
CRIME PROBLEMS.

00:02:00.404 --> 00:02:02.972
YOU CAN'T CONVINCE ME ALL THE

00:02:02.973 --> 00:02:03.740
POLITICAL ENERGY SPENT ON

00:02:03.741 --> 00:02:04.807
CATERING TO PEOPLE WHO SHOULDN'T

00:02:04.808 --> 00:02:09.412
BE HERE, THAT'S GOT TO DETRACT

00:02:09.413 --> 00:02:13.716
FROM MAKING THE CITY BETTER FOR

00:02:13.717 --> 00:02:14.617
EVERYONE ELSE.

00:02:14.618 --> 00:02:17.487
&gt;&gt; WE HAVE A SERIOUS MENTAL

00:02:17.488 --> 00:02:19.756
HEALTH ISSUE IN THE CITY AND

00:02:19.757 --> 00:02:21.891
CRIME PROBLEM AND WISH WE'D

00:02:21.892 --> 00:02:23.359
CONCENTRATE ON THOSE THINGS

00:02:23.360 --> 00:02:25.595
OPPOSED TO ILLEGALS IN OUR CITY.

00:02:25.596 --> 00:02:29.298
&gt;&gt; Tucker: SO YOUR MAYOR'S ALL

00:02:29.299 --> 00:02:31.434
IN AND ALDERMAN ARE ALL IN.

00:02:31.435 --> 00:02:33.269
WHAT'S THE MOTIVE?

00:02:36.407 --> 00:02:39.275
IT'S THE MAYOR AND ALDERMAN

00:02:39.276 --> 00:02:40.810
SUPPORTING THE SANCTUARY.

00:02:40.811 --> 00:02:42.278
THERE'S TWO OF US THAT DON'T

00:02:42.279 --> 00:02:45.348
SUPPORT THE SANCTUARY CITY.

00:02:45.349 --> 00:02:46.282
&gt;&gt; Tucker: BUT THEY'VE LEFT OF

00:02:46.283 --> 00:02:49.819
THE SOUTH SIDE OF YOUR CITY

00:02:54.625 --> 00:02:55.558
VIOLENCE DON'T LIKE IT?

00:02:55.559 --> 00:02:58.795
&gt;&gt; YOU'LL HAVE TO GET ONE OF MY

00:02:58.796 --> 00:03:02.865
COLLEAGUES FROM THE SOUTH SIDE,

00:03:02.866 --> 00:03:04.133
TUCKER.

00:03:04.134 --> 00:03:06.135
I KNOW IT BOTHERS ME.

00:03:06.136 --> 00:03:07.870
I THINK THE MONEY COULD BE

00:03:07.871 --> 00:03:09.105
BETTER SPENT.

00:03:09.106 --> 00:03:11.474
IF WE STICK WITH OUR SANCTUARY

00:03:11.475 --> 00:03:14.210
CITY POLICIES WE COULD LOSE $1

00:03:14.211 --> 00:03:15.511
MILLION OF FEDERAL FUNDS.

00:03:15.512 --> 00:03:17.948
I'M CONCERN ABOUT THAT.

